   "html": "<p>这类任务的独特之处：<strong>干净标签不存在</strong>。训练数据靠正演合成或自监督构造，因此投入重心不在标注，而在<b>噪声库是否贴近本区实际</b>。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 4 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 4</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>含噪炮集 / 叠前道集</span><span class='cl-s'>单工区 1 万—10 万道</span></span><span class='cl-n'>干净标签难获取，作评估与微调</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>合成噪声—信号对</span><span class='cl-s'>正演模型 + 噪声库采样生成，可无限扩增</span></span><span class='cl-n'>训练主粮，需覆盖本区噪声类型</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>处理员标注噪声区</span><span class='cl-s'>按噪声类型分档，每类 ≥ 500 道</span></span><span class='cl-n'>用于质检与分型统计</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='3'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>干扰源台账</span><span class='cl-s'>工业电干扰、邻近施工时段记录</span></span><span class='cl-n'>剔除不可恢复的坏道</span></div></div>"
